# Product language

RepoScope reports observed source-level dependencies. It does not predict runtime failures.

Use: observed dependency, potential investigation scope, declared value import, not resolved under this configuration.

Never write: this change will break N files, complete architecture, dead code proven, safe to delete.

Do not add an LLM, embeddings store, or remote analysis call. A later assistant would be a separate, off-by-default feature and must not create graph edges.
